ll on a persisted clock (same\n11757:   * ev_debris_stream_crossing cadence: one rake per roll on a persisted clock (the same\n11881:   * CR-CHAIN hitch cadence: one shed per roll on a persisted clock. The pod is real owned\n11968:   * Volatile-slough cadence: one pressurized pod per roll on a persisted clock, and only\n12060:   * CR-FEED cadence + the chew. One live feed chunk at a time on a persisted clock. While\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"rg -n \"^\\s+update\\(dt|^\\s+_update|step.*state\\.traffic\\.freighters|freighters\\[\\]|cadence|_tickEvery\" src/systems/traffic.js -g '!**/*.test.*' -m 40 2>$null","time":{"start":1792370436221,"end":1792370436229}},"id":"prt_1519a686b0010VR0vrFAgrri1k","sessionID":"ses_eae696937ffe0wN6WZCrNY9lxd","messageID":"msg_1519a3f990011tnzRwwCWyAwtn"}}
